      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Managed services unreachable.\nTwo real-world triggers:\n\n1 · ACCESS DENIED — sanctions or\nconflict block the region, or the\nprovider entirely.\n\n2 · DISASTER RECOVERY — power grid\nor fibre outage, extreme weather or\nconflict. DORA-class resilience.",
      "originalText": "Managed services unreachable.\nTwo real-world triggers:\n\n1 · ACCESS DENIED — sanctions or\nconflict block the region, or the\nprovider entirely.\n\n2 · DISASTER RECOVERY — power grid\nor fibre outage, extreme weather or\nconflict. DORA-class resilience.",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "t2b",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
