      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": null,
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Following Fundamental Patterns\nguidance for Sovereign Private Cloud\nwith Azure Local, customers build\nadaptive apps and redeploy when\ndisruption hits.\n\nSame container images.\nSame application definition.\nOnly the infrastructure changes —\nwith some degradation.",
      "originalText": "Following Fundamental Patterns\nguidance for Sovereign Private Cloud\nwith Azure Local, customers build\nadaptive apps and redeploy when\ndisruption hits.\n\nSame container images.\nSame application definition.\nOnly the infrastructure changes —\nwith some degradation.",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "t3b",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
